
>> motive := Wahaheʻe.
>> opportunity := Wahaheʻe.
Huapuka kākau: (motive ʻaʻole-lāua-ʻelua: opportunity).
Huapuka kākau: (motive ʻaʻole-naʻe & opportunity ʻaʻole-naʻe).

Huapuka kākau: (ʻOiaʻiʻo = ʻOiaʻiʻo).
Huapuka kākau: (ʻOiaʻiʻo ≠ ʻOiaʻiʻo).
Huapuka kākau: (ʻOiaʻiʻo ≠ Wahaheʻe).
Huapuka kākau: (ʻOiaʻiʻo = Wahaheʻe).
